        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ahaba wakambila Izebele malu onso akenza Eliya ne muakashiheye baprofete bonso ku miele ya nvita. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe Izebele wakatuma mukenji kudi Eliya ne, Nzambi yonso bambe kungenzela malu mabi onso binahanga kuvuisha muoyo webe bu muoyo wa umue wabo makelela ha diba edi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvueye dî edi, wakajuka, wakanyema bua kusungileye muoyo wandi; hakafikeye ku Bê-sheba wa mu buloba bua Yuda, wakashiyaku muntu wandi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi yeye nkayandi wakaya luendu lua dituku dimue mu tshihela, wakashikama hanshi muinshi mua mutshi wa genêt; wakalomba Nzambi bua kufueye, wamba ne, Kuakushika mpindiu, Yehowa angate muoyo wanyi, bualu bua meme tshiena muhite batatu banyi buakane. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalala tulu muinshi mua mutshi wa genêt: mona, muanjelo wakamulenga tshianza, wakamuambila ne, Juka biebe, udie. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakatabala, wakamona mutanda wa bidia mulamba ha makala a kahia ne mulondo wa mai ku mutu kuandi. Wakadia, wakanua, wakalala kabidi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Muanjelo wakalua kudiye tshiakabidi, wakamulenga tshianza, wamba ne, Juka biebe, udie, bualu bua luendu ludi lukutonda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakajuka, wakadia, wakanua, wakaya mu bukole bua bidia abi tô minya ne matuku makumi anai tô ne ku Holeba, mukuna wa Nzambi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakabuela mu nyongolo, wakalalamu; dî dia Yehowa diakalua kudiye, diakamukonka ne, Eliya, udi wenza tshinyi kunoko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakitaba ne, Nakadi ne lukunukunu lua bungi bualu bua Yehowa, Nzambi wa misumba; bualu bua Bena Isalele bakashiha tshihungidi tshiebe, bakela bioshelu biebe hanshi, bakashiha baprofete bebe ku miele ya nvita; anu meme nkayanyi ndi mushale, ne badi bakeba muoyo wanyi bua kûnyenga. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamuambila ne Uluhuke, wimane ku mukuna ku mpala kua Yehowa. Yehowa wakahita ne tshihehele tshinene tshikole tshiakahanda mikuna, tshiakatshibula mabue ku mpala kua Yehowa; kadi Yehowa mene kakadi mu tshihehele. Ku nyima kua tshihehele buloba buakakanka, kadi Yehowa mene kakadi mu kukanka kua buloba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ku nyima kua kukanka kua buloba, kahia kakadiku; kadi Yehowa mene kakadi mu kahia. Ku nyima kua kahia dî dikese ditekete diakunvuika. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hakunvua Eliya dî adi, wakavunga tshikowelu tshiandi ku mpala kuandi, wakaluhuka, wakimana ku mushiku wa nyongolo. Dî diakalua kudiye, diakamukonka ne, Eliya, udi wenza tshinyi kunoko? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakamba ne, Nakadi ne lukunukunu lua bungi bualu bua Yehowa, Nzambi wa misumba; bualu bua Bena Isalele bakashiha tshihungidi tshiebe, bakela bioshelu biebe hanshi, bakashiha baprofete bebe ku miele ya nvita, anu meme nkayanyi ndi mushale, badi bakeba muoyo wanyi bua kûnyenga.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yehowa wakamuambila ne, Walukile mu nshila wa mu tshihela tshia ku Damaseke; hawafikaku, bûdi nʼabu mbua kuela Hazaele manyi ha mutu bua kuikaleye mukelenge ku mutu kua Bena Sulia; ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "wele Yehu, muana wa Nimishi, manyi ha mutu bua kuikaleye mukelenge ku mutu kua Bena Isalele; wele Elisha, muana wa Shafata wa mu Abele-mehola, manyi ha mutu bua kuikaleye muprofete mu muaba webe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Hashishe muntu udi uhanduka ku muele wa nvita wa Hazaele, Yehu neamushihe; muntu udi uhanduka ku muele wa nvita wa Yehu, Elisha neamushihe. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kadi nenshale bianyi ne bantu binunu muanda mutekete mu Isalele, badi kabayi banze kutua binu biabo hanshi kudi Bâla, badi kabayi banze kuluangana nʼandi mishiku.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakumukaku, wakasangila ne Elisha, muana wa Shafata, wakadi wihila budimi ne bikokedi bia ngombe dikumi ne bibidi: yeye wakadi wenda ku tshikokedi tshia dikumi ne tshibidi; Eliya wakafika kudiye, wakela tshikowelu tshiandi hamʼbidi nʼandi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yeye wakalekela ngombe yandi, wakalonda Eliya lubilu, wakamba ne, Ndi nkusengelela ne, Witabushe bua meme kuya kusangana ne tatu wanyi ne mamu wanyi mishiku, hashishe nenkulonde. Yeye wakamuambila ne, Hingana kabidi, nakukuenzela tshinyi? ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "1KI 19:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wakalukila, wakangata ngombe ya ku tshikokedi, wakayishiha, wakatumpa minyinyi yai ne mutshi wa tshikokedi, wakayila bantu bandi, bobo bakadia. Hashishe wakajuka, wakalonda Eliya, wakamukuatshila mudimu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "1KI.19.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "1KI.19.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
